| Layout (§8) | nest `Linear.apply/%3`, 93 points at `[2, 4] [4, 16]`; chosen tiled, tile [2, 4], kblock none, order IJ, lanes 4, split none, no pack, epilogue, 0.0115 µs, bound by loads; runner-up tiled, tile [2, 16], kblock none, order JI, lanes 4, split none, no pack, 0.0115 µs |
| Kernel (§9) | `k2`: `kernel dot+add (%0 : f32[batch: 2, 16], %1 : f32[16, 4], %2 : bf16[4]) -> %3 : f32[batch: 2, 4]` |

